{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>After she had been sent away.</b> When the Holy One, blessed be He, said to him in Midian, ״Go, return to Egypt,״ and Moses took his wife and his sons, etc., and Aaron went out to meet him and encountered him at the mountain of Elohim (Exodus 4) — he said to him: Who are these? He said to him: This is my wife whom I married in Midian, and these are my sons. He said to him: And where are you taking them? He said to him: To Egypt. He said to him: Over the first ones we are suffering, and you come to add to them?! He said to her: Go to your father's house. She took her two sons and went her way (Mekhilta)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:53.414388859Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}